{"id": "c7924670-1cfc-4852-a2e0-3a07a9facfa2", "slug": "nexus-autonomous-synthesis", "title": "Nexus - Autonomous Synthesis", "description": "Autonomous Synthesis Form Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus - Autonomous Synthesis\"\ndescription: \"Autonomous Synthesis Form Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B981\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#34D399\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#262626\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#262626\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus - Autonomous Synthesis\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 5; favorites: 6; remixes: 0.\nTags: form, css, interactive, input, validation, responsive.\n## Overview\nAutonomous Synthesis Form Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNexus Control System Nominal Input Parameters Calibrate synthesis telemetry. Adjust baseline scalar values. The procedural engine interprets these constraints to architect structural permutations. Processing Core Quantu…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Calibrate synthesis telemetry..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #34D399, background #FFFFFF, surface #262626, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth bg-[#030303]\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus - Autonomous Synthesis</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'] },\n                    colors: {\n                        emerald: { 400: '#34d399', 500: '#10b981' },\n                        neutral: { 800: '#262626', 900: '#171717', 950: '#0a0a0a' }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Icons -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js (Import Map) -->\n    <script type=\"importmap\">\n        {\n            \"imports\": {\n                \"three\": \"https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js\"\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-neutral-300 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-emerald-500/30 selection:text-emerald-50\"\n      style=\"background-color: #050505; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Atmospheric Glows & Textures -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 12px);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed top-[-20%] left-[-10%] w-[60%] h-[60%] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,rgba(16,185,129,0.03)_0%,transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none blur-3xl z-0\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Global Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-between px-4 md:px-12 z-0 opacity-20\">\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-white/[0.1] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-16 -left-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 border border-white/40 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:block w-px h-full bg-white/[0.05]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:block w-px h-full bg-white/[0.05]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-white/[0.1] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-16 -left-[5px] w-2.5 h-2.5 border border-white/40 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- App Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen px-4 md:px-12 py-8 mx-auto max-w-[1600px] w-full gap-8\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-4 border-b border-white/[0.04]\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded border border-white/[0.08] bg-black/40 flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-500/10 blur-md\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:command-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-emerald-400 text-sm relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-200 font-normal\">Nexus Control</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_#10b981]\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500\">System Nominal</span>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/[0.05] bg-white/[0.02] hover:bg-white/[0.05] transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Bento Grid Layout -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-8 pb-12\">\n\n            <!-- Top Split Section -->\n            <section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 min-h-[500px] md:min-h-[600px]\">\n\n                <!-- Left: Configuration Surface -->\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 interactive-card relative rounded-3xl bg-neutral-900/40 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/[0.04] p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col overflow-hidden group\">\n                    <!-- Hover Spotlight -->\n                    <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px rounded-3xl opacity-0 transition duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(600px circle at var(--x, 50%) var(--y, 50%), rgba(255,255,255,0.06), transparent 40%);\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- L-Brackets -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-white/20 opacity-50\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-white/20 opacity-50\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/20 opacity-50\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/20 opacity-50\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full justify-between\">\n                        <!-- Header Content -->\n                        <div class=\"mb-12\">\n                            <span class=\"inline-block mb-6 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 text-xs text-emerald-400 tracking-widest uppercase\">Input Parameters</span>\n                            <h1 class=\"reveal-text text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tighter text-white leading-tight mb-4\">\n                                Calibrate synthesis telemetry.\n                            </h1>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">\n                                Adjust baseline scalar values. The procedural engine interprets these constraints to architect structural permutations.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Instrumentation Stack -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\">\n                            <!-- Algorithm Dropdown -->\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                                <label class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500\">Processing Core</label>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.05] bg-black/40 hover:border-white/[0.1] transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-200 font-light\">Quantum Heuristics V4</span>\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-neutral-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Density Slider -->\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                    <label class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500\">Structure Density</label>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400\">0.84</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"h-1.5 w-full bg-black rounded-full border border-white/[0.05] relative cursor-pointer group/slider\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-[84%] bg-emerald-500/30 rounded-full\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-[84%] -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-3 h-3 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(16,185,129,0.6)] group-hover/slider:scale-125 transition-transform\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Async Toggle -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-2\">\n                                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                                    <label class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-200\">Asynchronous Mapping</label>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light\">Offload calculations to secondary grid</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Custom Toggle -->\n                                <div class=\"w-10 h-5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 p-[2px] flex items-center justify-end cursor-pointer shadow-[inset_0_0_10px_rgba(16,185,129,0.1)]\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full shadow-sm\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right: WebGL Visualization -->\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 interactive-card relative rounded-3xl bg-black border border-white/[0.04] overflow-hidden group min-h-[400px]\">\n                    <!-- Hover Spotlight Border Effect -->\n                    <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px rounded-3xl opacity-0 transition duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(400px circle at var(--x, 50%) var(--y, 50%), rgba(255,255,255,0.15), transparent 40%);\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-[1px] bg-black rounded-[calc(1.5rem-1px)] z-0\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- WebGL Container -->\n                    <div id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 w-full h-full opacity-80 mix-blend-screen fallback-bg\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Inner Frame/Vignette -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20 pointer-events-none shadow-[inset_0_0_120px_#000000]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20 pointer-events-none border border-white/[0.02] rounded-3xl m-3\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Center Overlay Node -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-30 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\">\n                        <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <!-- Pulsing Rings (Animated via JS) -->\n                            <div class=\"pulse-ring absolute w-24 h-24 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/40 opacity-0\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"pulse-ring absolute w-32 h-32 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/20 opacity-0\" style=\"animation-delay: 1s\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"pulse-ring absolute w-48 h-48 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/10 opacity-0\" style=\"animation-delay: 2s\"></div>\n\n                            <!-- Central Glass Pill -->\n                            <div class=\"bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-3 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] pointer-events-auto\">\n                                <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center w-2 h-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute w-full h-full bg-emerald-400 rounded-full opacity-50 animate-ping\" style=\"animation-duration: 3s;\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal tracking-widest uppercase text-white\">Stream Active</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Top Right Readout -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 z-30 flex flex-col items-end gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-emerald-500/70\">X: 14.009</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-emerald-500/70\">Y: 88.214</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Row: Observability (5 / 7 Asymmetric) -->\n            <section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8\">\n\n                <!-- Card 1: System Telemetry (5 cols) -->\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 interactive-card relative rounded-3xl bg-neutral-900/40 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/[0.04] p-8 overflow-hidden group\">\n                    <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px rounded-3xl opacity-0 transition duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(400px circle at var(--x, 50%) var(--y, 50%), rgba(255,255,255,0.06), transparent 40%);\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500\">Node Status</span>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:graph-up-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center gap-6\">\n                            <!-- Metric Row -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between border-b border-white/[0.04] pb-4\">\n                                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-light\">Latency</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight\">12ms</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Micro Sparkline Chart (Simulated with divs) -->\n                                <div class=\"flex items-end gap-1 h-8\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-white/10 h-[30%] rounded-t-sm\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-white/10 h-[50%] rounded-t-sm\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-white/10 h-[40%] rounded-t-sm\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-white/10 h-[70%] rounded-t-sm\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-white/20 h-[60%] rounded-t-sm\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-emerald-500/50 h-[80%] rounded-t-sm relative shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.3)]\"><div class=\"absolute -top-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\"></div></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Metric Row -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between\">\n                                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-light\">Throughput</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight\">8.4TB/s</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400\">+2.4%</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2: Signal Pipeline (7 cols) -->\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 interactive-card relative rounded-3xl bg-neutral-900/40 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/[0.04] p-8 overflow-hidden group flex flex-col\">\n                    <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px rounded-3xl opacity-0 transition duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(500px circle at var(--x, 50%) var(--y, 50%), rgba(255,255,255,0.06), transparent 40%);\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500\">Pipeline Trace</span>\n                        <div class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05] text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400\">ID: AX-9902</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Flow Diagram (Grid based) -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex-1 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 px-4\">\n                        <!-- Background Connecting Line -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-8 right-8 h-px bg-white/[0.05] -translate-y-1/2 hidden md:block z-0\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Nodes -->\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-3\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black flex items-center justify-center shadow-[inset_0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.02)]\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:folder-open-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-neutral-500\">Ingest</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-3\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-black flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(16,185,129,0.1)] relative\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-[-4px] border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-full border-dashed animate-[spin_10s_linear_infinite]\"></div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-bolt-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-emerald-400\">Process</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-3\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black flex items-center justify-center opacity-50\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-neutral-600\">Store</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </section>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts for Logic & Animation -->\n    <script type=\"module\">\n        import * as THREE from 'three';\n\n        // --- 1. Three.js Matrix Flow (2D Style WebGL) ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            if (!container) return;\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            // Orthographic camera for 2D flat look\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0.1, 10);\n            camera.position.z = 1;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Matrix config\n            const cols = 60;\n            const dashesPerCol = 20;\n            const count = cols * dashesPerCol;\n\n            // Thin short line geometry\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(0.003, 0.04);\n            const material = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x10b981,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.8,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.InstancedMesh(geometry, material, count);\n            const dummy = new THREE.Object3D();\n            const speeds = new Float32Array(count);\n\n            let index = 0;\n            for (let i = 0; i < cols; i++) {\n                // Spread columns evenly across -1 to 1 X-axis\n                const x = (i / cols) * 2 - 1 + (1 / cols);\n                // Assign a specific speed base per column for cohesive flow\n                const colSpeed = 0.002 + Math.random() * 0.005;\n\n                for (let j = 0; j < dashesPerCol; j++) {\n                    dummy.position.x = x;\n                    // Randomize initial vertical position\n                    dummy.position.y = (Math.random() * 2) - 1;\n                    dummy.updateMatrix();\n                    mesh.setMatrixAt(index, dummy.matrix);\n\n                    speeds[index] = colSpeed + (Math.random() * 0.001); // Slight variation\n\n                    // Fade colors slightly for depth\n                    const colorIntensity = 0.2 + Math.random() * 0.8;\n                    mesh.setColorAt(index, new THREE.Color(0x10b981).multiplyScalar(colorIntensity));\n\n                    index++;\n                }\n            }\n\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n                for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n                    mesh.getMatrixAt(i, dummy.matrix);\n                    dummy.position.setFromMatrixPosition(dummy.matrix);\n\n                    dummy.position.y -= speeds[i];\n\n                    // Reset position at top when falls below bottom\n                    if (dummy.position.y < -1.1) {\n                        dummy.position.y = 1.1;\n                    }\n\n                    dummy.updateMatrix();\n                    mesh.setMatrixAt(i, dummy.matrix);\n                }\n\n                mesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize WebGL if supported\n        try { initWebGL(); } catch (e) { console.log('WebGL fallback activated.'); }\n\n\n        // --- 2. GSAP Animations & Interactions ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Word Reveal Animation\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-text');\n            revealElements.forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerText;\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                el.innerHTML = ''; // Clear\n\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    const outer = document.createElement('span');\n                    outer.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    outer.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    outer.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n                    outer.style.marginRight = '0.25em';\n\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    inner.innerText = word;\n                    inner.classList.add('gsap-word');\n                    // Style to ensure proper spacing if empty\n                    if(word === '') outer.style.marginRight = '0';\n\n                    outer.appendChild(inner);\n                    el.appendChild(outer);\n                });\n\n                // ScrollTrigger for words\n                gsap.fromTo(el.querySelectorAll('.gsap-word'),\n                    { y: '100%', opacity: 0 },\n                    {\n                        y: '0%',\n                        opacity: 1,\n                        duration: 0.8,\n                        stagger: 0.04,\n                        ease: 'power3.out',\n                        scrollTrigger: {\n                            trigger: el,\n                            start: 'top 90%',\n                            toggleActions: 'play none none reverse'\n                        }\n                    }\n                );\n            });\n\n            // Interactive Card Spotlight Hover Effect\n            const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.interactive-card');\n            cards.forEach(card => {\n                card.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {\n                    const rect = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n                    const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n                    card.style.setProperty('--x', `${x}px`);\n                    card.style.setProperty('--y', `${y}px`);\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Pulsing Rings Animation (Central Node)\n            const rings = document.querySelectorAll('.pulse-ring');\n            rings.forEach((ring, index) => {\n                gsap.fromTo(ring,\n                    { scale: 0.8, opacity: 1 },\n                    {\n                        scale: 2.5,\n                        opacity: 0,\n                        duration: 3,\n                        repeat: -1,\n                        ease: \"power1.out\",\n                        delay: index * 0.8\n                    }\n                );\n            });\n\n            // Stagger load bottom cards\n            gsap.fromTo('.interactive-card',\n                { y: 30, opacity: 0 },\n                {\n                    y: 0,\n                    opacity: 1,\n                    duration: 1,\n                    stagger: 0.1,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\",\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: \"main\",\n                        start: \"top 80%\"\n                    }\n                }\n            );\n        });\n    </script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Fallback background if WebGL fails to load/run */\n        .fallback-bg {\n            background-image:\n                repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0, transparent 4px, rgba(16,185,129,0.05) 4px, rgba(16,185,129,0.05) 8px),\n                radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(16,185,129,0.1) 0%, transparent 60%);\n        }\n    </style>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-autonomous-synthesis.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-autonomous-synthesis.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-autonomous-synthesis-DESIGN.md", "views": 72, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T22:54:56.663444+00:00"}